{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2022-09-27 10:00:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP AND MODERN LIFE PARTNER TO ACCELERATE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION IN LIFE INSURANCE', 'text': "RADNOR, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP (NYSE: LNC) TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW PARTNERSHIP BETWEEN LINCOLN FINANCIAL DISTRIBUTORS (LFD), ITS WHOLESALE DISTRIBUTION FRANCHISE, AND MODERN LIFE, A TECH-ENABLED LIFE INSURANCE BROKERAGE. THE PARTNERSHIP WILL ENABLE LINCOLN'S LIFE INSURANCE PRODUCT PORTFOLIO TO BE DELIVERED ON MODERN LIFE'S DIGITAL PLATFORM, PROVIDING AN IMPROVED DIGITAL END-TO-END EXPERIENCE – AN IMPORTANT PILLAR OF BOTH COMPANIES' SHARED COMMITMENT TO INNOVATION AND SUPPOR"}